+/**
+ * S8-G G2 live-proof helpers: derived by substitution from the accepted S8-C harness
+ * test/utils/g2-s8c-pg-harness.ts (at 1c5fbb04), which stays byte-identical. Same real psql, same
+ * real generated Prisma client in separate OS processes (test/utils/g2-s8g-worker.cjs drives the
+ * real ScoutService → ScoutLifecycleService → ScoutReconstructService settle path with the owned
+ * family registry injected from an explicit fixture source spec + native rule set), no transaction
+ * or query mocks; bound to the S8-G-only identity guard test/utils/g2-s8g-db.ts and the G2_S8G_*
+ * environment. Only test/rls-g2-s8g.spec.ts (via test/utils/g2-s8g-harness.ts) imports this.
+ *
+ * There is no OLD side: S8-G ships no migration, so the base 1c5fbb04 prisma tree (through the
